-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
DVS_PLACEHOLDER_CERTIFICATE_REPLACE_IN_CI
Non-production placeholder for the DVS (integration) reader-auth certificate
chain (L4 leaf first, followed by the issuing CA certificates). Intentionally NOT
a valid X.509 chain. The build pipeline replaces this file with the real chain
returned by the L3 CA /issue-reader-cert endpoint before publishing. Never use
this app or its bundled key material in production.
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
